## PR Title
Add --unroll-limit option (#6654)

## PR Description
Splits the dual-purpose `--unroll-count` knob requested in issue #6654 by introducing a new option that controls only the upper-bound used for infinite-loop detection in generate loops, V3Simulate and `unroll_full`, leaving `--unroll-count` to apply to procedural loops as before. The flag was originally proposed as `--unroll-error`; reviewer feedback led to renaming it to `--unroll-limit` to be consistent with `--converge-limit`.

